00:05:07.534 --> 00:05:08.667
And it was so fun.

00:05:08.667 --> 00:05:10.300
-Disney knows
how to do it up, man.

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:12.634
-Oh, my God, it's the coolest
thing in the world.

00:05:12.634 --> 00:05:14.067
