00:05:52.334 --> 00:05:54.367
-Her eyes.
-Her eyes are twinkly.

00:05:54.367 --> 00:05:57.200
And, like, her hands
are really beautiful.

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:59.601
And I felt like, "Okay."

00:05:59.601 --> 00:06:02.000
-Yeah. And then you have to,
like, be the villain to her,

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:03.334
which is just so fun.

00:06:03.334 --> 00:06:04.734
-It was real fun.

00:06:04.734 --> 00:06:08.367
-Let's talk about "Loot"
and how funny this is.

00:06:08.367 --> 00:06:10.367
Oh, my gosh.
I love the premise of it.

00:06:10.367 --> 00:06:12.467
You are so good in this.
-Thank you, bud.

00:06:12.467 --> 00:06:14.200
-There's so many good
little, like,

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:16.834
Maya Rudolphy aside jokes
