for a fresher champagne.

00:07:27.868 --> 00:07:29.834
-Exactly.
-And -- Yeah.

00:07:29.834 --> 00:07:32.167
-It must be nice.
-It must be nice, yeah.

00:07:32.167 --> 00:07:35.267
